msgid "Documentation languages"
msgstr "文档语言"

msgid ""
"English is the default language at the existing site URLs. Simplified Chinese is published under "
"``zh_CN/``. Use **English · 简体中文** in the sidebar to switch to the same page in the other "
"language. Each language has its own search index. The switch also works inside an isolated PR "
"preview and does not send readers to the published version of an unmerged page."
msgstr ""
"现有网址默认使用英文，简体中文版发布在 ``zh_CN/`` 下。侧栏 **English · 简体中文** 可切换到另一语言的同一页面。每种语言有独立搜索索引。在独立 PR "
"预览内切换也会保留预览路径，不会跳到未合并页面的主站版本。"

msgid ""
"The guides, tutorial index and API prose are translated. Python identifiers, signatures, type "
"expressions, native configuration names, literal units, code examples and notebook contents are "
"shared unchanged. Both language sites offer the original English notebooks for download. "
"Translated pages do not execute the notebooks or load PyROOT into the documentation process."
msgstr ""
"使用指南、教程目录和 API 说明提供中文翻译。Python 标识符、签名、类型表达式、原生配置名、字面单位、代码示例及 notebook 内容共用原文。两种站点均下载同一英文 "
"notebook。翻译页面不会执行 notebook，也不会将 PyROOT 加载到文档进程。"

msgid "Build both languages"
msgstr "构建两种语言"

msgid "From the repository root, activate the development environment, install the package, and run:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录激活开发环境、安装包，然后运行："

msgid ""
"The build checks translation coverage, then builds English at the output root and Chinese in "
"``zh_CN/``, with separate Sphinx doctrees and strict warnings. Serve the combined directory to "
"test both language links:"
msgstr "构建先检查翻译覆盖，再在输出根生成英文、在 ``zh_CN/`` 生成中文。两种语言使用独立 doctree，严格将警告视为错误。可以启动静态服务检查语言切换："

msgid "For an individual language during editing, use Sphinx directly:"
msgstr "编辑时只构建一种语言，可直接调用 Sphinx："

msgid "Maintain translations"
msgstr "维护翻译"

msgid ""
"English reStructuredText and Python docstrings remain the source of truth. Chinese translations "
"live in ``docs/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po``, including the nested ``api/index.po`` and "
"``tutorials/index.po`` catalogs. Sphinx uses gettext to translate prose while preserving document"
" names and API anchors. Notebook catalogs are deliberately omitted."
msgstr ""
"英文 reStructuredText 和 Python docstring 是内容来源。中文译文位于 ``docs/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po``，包括嵌套的"
" ``api/index.po`` 与 ``tutorials/index.po``。Sphinx 通过 gettext 翻译说明，同时保留文档名和 API 锚点。故意不提供 notebook "
"消息目录。"

msgid "Extract current messages before updating a translation:"
msgstr "更新译文前提取当前消息："

msgid ""
"Compare the generated catalogs with the matching PO files, retain the original ``msgid`` exactly "
"and update the Chinese ``msgstr``. Preserve cross-reference roles, links, math and inline markup;"
" keep type expressions unchanged so their API references still resolve. Do not mark unreviewed "
"translations as complete. The combined build rejects missing, empty or fuzzy translations outside"
" notebooks, so changed guide/API prose must be accompanied by its Chinese translation. Compiled "
"MO files and generated POT files are build products and are not committed."
msgstr ""
"对照生成的 catalog 更新对应 PO 文件；原 ``msgid`` 必须完全不变，中文写在 ``msgstr``。保留交叉引用 role、链接、公式和行内标记；类型表达式保持原文以正确解析"
" API 引用。未审阅译文不要标记完成。双语构建拒绝 notebook 之外缺失、空白或 fuzzy 的翻译，因此修改指南/API 说明需同步更新中文。编译 MO 和生成 POT "
"是构建产物，不提交。"

msgid "Publishing"
msgstr "发布"

msgid ""
"CI validates and packages both languages together. The regular GitHub Pages site is deployed from"
" ``develop`` after merge. Feature branches can publish only an explicitly selected, marked PR "
"preview; both language variants carry its source commit and unmerged notice. A local build does "
"not update the online site."
msgstr ""
"CI 一起验证并打包两种语言，合并到 ``develop`` 后部署正式 GitHub Pages。功能分支只能通过显式指定的带标识 PR "
"预览发布，两种语言均附源提交与未合并提示。本地构建不等于在线站点已更新。"

msgid "Architecture diagrams"
msgstr "架构流程图"

msgid ""
"The :doc:`architecture` page uses native Mermaid diagrams. Shared graph structure is maintained "
"in ``docs/diagrams/*.mmd``; matching ``*.zh_CN.mmd`` files translate node and edge labels. Update"
" both variants when changing a diagram's meaning. The Mermaid extension selects the language-"
"specific source automatically; diagram labels are not taken from the PO catalogs."
msgstr ""
":doc:`architecture` 页面使用原生 Mermaid 图。图结构在 ``docs/diagrams/*.mmd`` 中维护，对应 ``*.zh_CN.mmd`` "
"翻译节点与边标签。改变图的含义时同步更新两种版本。Mermaid 扩展自动选择相应语言文件，图内标签不从 PO 目录读取。"

msgid ""
"HTML diagrams render in the browser using Mermaid 12.2.0 from jsDelivr. Reading diagrams "
"requires JavaScript and access to that CDN. Strict Sphinx builds check document integration; also"
" check the rendered diagrams in a browser after editing graph syntax. Mermaid is a documentation "
"dependency, not a megalibpy runtime dependency, and does not execute the scientific examples."
msgstr ""
"HTML 图表在浏览器使用 jsDelivr 提供的 Mermaid 12.2.0 渲染，需要启用 JavaScript 并能访问该 CDN。严格 Sphinx "
"构建检查文档接入；修改图语法后还需在浏览器检查真实显示。Mermaid 仅为文档依赖，不是 megalibpy 运行依赖，也不执行科学示例。"
